---
/** Eyebrow: fio caramelo + microtexto uppercase ([t3:] no wireframe). */
---

<p class="eyebrow t3"><span class="eyebrow__line" aria-hidden="true"></span><slot /></p>

<style>
  .eyebrow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: clamp(16px, 2.1vw, 30px);
    margin-bottom: clamp(16px, 1.7vw, 24px);
  }

  .eyebrow__line {
    width: clamp(32px, 3.7vw, 53px);
    height: 1px;
    background: currentColor;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }
</style>
